      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:6:8:45:6",
      "text": [
        " كُنْتُ مَعَهُ أَقُودُهُ فَأَدْخَلْتُهُ الْحَمَّامَ فَرَأَيْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) يَتَنَوَّرُ فَدَنَا مِنْهُ أَبُو بَصِيرٍ فَسَلَّمَ عَلَيْهِ فَقَالَ يَا أَبَا بَصِيرٍ تَنَوَّرْ فَقَالَ إِنَّمَا تَنَوَّرْتُ أَوَّلَ مِنْ أَمْسِ وَ الْيَوْمَ الثَّالِثَ فَقَالَ أَ مَا عَلِمْتَ أَنَّهَا طَهُورٌ فَتَنَوَّرْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Isa, from one of his companions, from Ali Bin Abu Hamza, from Abu Baseer who said, ",
          "‘I (Abu Hamza) was with him (Abu Baseer) guiding him (as he was blind), so I entered the bathhouse, and I saw Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> applying <span class=\"iTxt\">Noura</span>. So Abu Baseer went near him and greeted him<sup>asws</sup>, so he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘O Abu Baseer! Apply <span class=\"iTxt\">Noura</span>’. So he said, ‘But rather, I had applied <span class=\"iTxt\">Noura</span> first thing yesterday, and the third day’. So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘But do you not know that is it a cleanser? Therefore you should apply <span class=\"iTxt\">Noura</span>’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "6. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad ibn ‘Isa from certain persons of his people from Ali ibn abu Hamzah from abu Basir who has said the following: “I once led abu Basir to a bathhouse and I saw abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, apply lime. Abu Basir went close to him (the Imam) and offered greeting of peace. He (the Imam) asked, ‘O abu Basir, do you like to apply lime paste?’ He replied, ‘Only three days ago I had applied it.’ He (the Imam) said, ‘Do you know that it is purification? So you should apply it.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
